Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:30.10,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:34.90,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}Whoa! {\kf70}High,{\kf61} {\kf102}high, {\kf113}high!
