Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:05.76,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
