Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:11.68,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:11.68,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My tooth feels kind of wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it! Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... An adult tooth will be coming in underneath it, so just leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like me to make porridge from your rice for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll be fine if I eat it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.07,0:02:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That drawing's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your dad is always the one who comes to these things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Although he's not my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! He's not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, isn't that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey! Rin-chan's the best at drawing in Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you could be a mangaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This stylish guy is... a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.27,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,He's really tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Sayaka-chan said her dad is 31, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? What a pleasant coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've only done a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was when I was younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I might have seen you in our company's catalogue...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if it's not too much trouble, can I ask the name of your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's probably me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.77,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,He's cheerful, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is so embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nowadays, I'm an office manager, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That feels like kind of a waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Modeling's the sort of job where you don't really know where your next paycheck is coming from,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so when my daughter was born, I decided to call it quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, I did nothing but drink and complain about work...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Micchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nabe-chin! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're old classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We both come from around this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He has a kid, too; a boy in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Rin-chan's father, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These two seem like the kind who really look out for their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My shop's on the corner of the nearby shopping district.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, we often buy croquettes there and eat them on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Glad to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I've befriended a couple of other fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In a way, my world might be wider now than it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's grown very cold all of a sudden, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like the kids have already gone to the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope he's remembered to wear his jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it must have been so much work to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, kid... Everyone's gone to the gym already. {HAHAHA Like father; like son}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap. The teacher's going to yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boys can be so awful sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So cute! How many months old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Almost ten months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babies are so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is so nostalgic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then last week, our kid got the flu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:07.66,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:08.81,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That must have been hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it that season already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if their fever falls, you have to keep them out of school for two days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To make sure it doesn't spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... We sent him straight back to school as soon as his fever fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess you have to, right? Can't afford to lose your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he was more or less better, so I figured the virus was dying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And even if he did pass it on, nobody would know who it came form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I could actually see some sense in what they were saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and that just depressed me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What they said about work... They could have been talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When it gets cold, I start worrying about every little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your pyjamas on, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When winter passes and it starts to get warmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can finally relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm just going to get my school bag. Wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two stupid or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said that it was cold in the gym, and you should wear your jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And don't run in the corridors!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's already starting to lose his baby teeth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I keep telling him that throwing them on the roof doesn't do any good when you're in an apartment block.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:58.55,Notes,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: In some areas of Japan, kids throw their baby teeth onto the roof as a charm to make strong teeth grow in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, he won't listen to anything I say to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm not one to talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd strip down to my underwear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and bound down the stairs two at a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd gobble up my lunch and drink my milk in one gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels really weird telling kids not to do all of the stuff that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did all of those things, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's pretty normal for a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,which includes Kouki, I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you were like that, too, then that's a load off my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Walk with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about we split into a boys' team and a girls' team?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's face is a little flushed, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think she has a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It might get worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her cheeks are much more red than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now, make sure that all of her family members wear masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good news, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I feel kind of weird around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said that it was a stomach bug, so don't force yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I feel kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A washbowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Rin is...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Call an ambulance right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I've already taken her to the doctor, and we have medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she just won't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever's getting higher and higher, and she's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose you didn't wrap her up warm enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now's not the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you tried mixing the medicine in with juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You always drank it right away if it was mixed with something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just one gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi. {AWWWWWW}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to wake you so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:47.33,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, what's with the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the flu, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, go watch some TV over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quietly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She just fell asleep a little while ago, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't look like she's sleeping much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not even sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Has she been able to drink anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was told to give her sports drinks at very least, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She won't drink, and she won't eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As an adult, you have to stay calm and tell her that things are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen her like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be like that. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When children are really in trouble, they need an adult by their side to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan will be fine as long as you're with her, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mum...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want some ice to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you're awake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I was at the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In a little while, try having a little more ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you eat too much at once, you'll shock your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll put something sweet and tasty in the freezer for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, you're going to be late for work, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's doing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be fine as long as you're there for her, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, too, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... {Kouki is actually really cute... XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I might have to take tomorrow off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you eat a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you're ill, you get to eat nothing but sweet things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After a little more rest, you'll be all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to be Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd shrug off a bug like this in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How are you, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you some yummy rice porridge now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever's gone up again since this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even without a fever, your body temperature rises as the day goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But just a while ago, it was more than 39 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go! Put this in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made some for you too, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Rin needs water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you stay in here. You don't want to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's really relaxed, knowing you're around, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, Rin-chan. Have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. Kouki eats this when he gets sick, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's special porridge that'll make you well in no time at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun has it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever he eats it, he gets better just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.15,0:20:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I feel good! {YAYE!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you tell your mum thanks for everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She looked after Rin, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.81,0:22:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, can I go home with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mum's supposed to come here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But mum's in bed with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{DUN DUN DUN! Oh no, if you kill her off I will cry and cry and cry and cry and... ;__;}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{If it weren't for the ominous music, I'd say it's just a joke, but... :-}
